      "derivation": "psql, independent of the app: average elapsed time from order to refund request, by reason, across every refund regardless of status. First try used whole calendar days and got it wrong - some rows have a real time-of-day, so that silently dropped precision. Redone with the full timestamp difference. wrong_item (236.97 days) is Charlotte Dubois's Wireless Keyboard, the same row already checked in mixed-07-wrong-item-window-compliance."
